  <result aggregation-status="0" type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Output/s</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output/s as listed by the project staff.</narrative>
   </description>
   <indicator measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 2  Indicator 1</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Transmission infrastructure to deliver renewable energy supply enhanced. 
Indicator: 11.5 km of 33 kV medium-voltage network constructed to evacuate power from the 20 MW solar power plant to the power dispatch center. 
Progress/Status: Preparation of bidding documents for the 33kV connection from the Fualu solar power plant to the Popua substation and the 11kV feeder upgrade is on hold until issues with the 20MW Fualu solar PV project (RAPID Project) are resolved.

The issuance of the invitation for bid is contingent on the signing of the PPA for the 20-megawatt solar photovoltaic in Fualu (RAPID Project). 
Data Source: TPL annual reports; project progress reports. 
Actual value:</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline value="0" year="2023"></baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2028-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2028-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="11.5"></target>
    </period>
   </indicator>
   <indicator measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 2  Indicator 2</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Transmission infrastructure to deliver renewable energy supply enhanced. 
Indicator: 7.5 km of the existing 11 kV transmission line rehabilitated and upgraded. 
Progress/Status: Preparation of bidding documents for the 33kV connection from the Fualu solar power plant to the Popua substation and the 11kV feeder upgrade is on hold until issues with the 20MW Fualu solar PV project (RAPID Project) are resolved.

The issuance of the invitation for bid is contingent on the signing of the PPA for the 20-megawatt solar photovoltaic in Fualu (RAPID Project). 
Data Source: TPL annual reports; project progress reports. 
Actual value:</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline value="0" year="2023"></baseline>
    <period>
